/*
 * Per-hull stats for every ship, keyed by the same Frontier `symbol` as
 * data/ships/ships.jsonc. Join the two on `symbol`.
 *
 * Source:  EDCD/coriolis-data, ships/*.json properties (commit 0db9234b5b9ce8c939ea84133d7ce336eea88e27)
 *          https://github.com/EDCD/coriolis-data
 *          The JSON stat values are Elite Dangerous game data, property of
 *          Frontier Developments plc, redistributed under Frontier's media-usage
 *          terms: https://forums.frontier.co.uk/threads/510879/
 *
 * Fields: hullMass (t), speed / boost (m/s), baseShieldStrength / baseArmour,
 * hardness, masslock, crew, heatCapacity, reserveFuelCapacity (t),
 * pitch / roll / yaw (deg/s), minThrust (%), pipSpeed. Present only where
 * coriolis carries the hull (47/48).
 *
 * Full provenance: data/ships/SOURCES.md.
 */
